--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Attempt 2 (final): NONE. No pin mismatch, no device-class mismatch, no short, no open.
  No R-vs-X element-prefix case arises: this design extracts no resistor device at all.
  Checked, not assumed.

  Attempt 1 (recorded because it is the reason attempt 2 exists) -- ONE root cause:
  | # | Symptom                                                  | Diagnosis | Belongs to |
  |---|----------------------------------------------------------|-----------|------------|
  | 1 | 2x magic `Ports "B" and "A" are electrically shorted`    | the coil  | TOOLING    |
  | 2 | `.subckt routed VDD Vcont Iref VSS` -- 4 ports, not 6    | short propagated into parent, fusing VDD+voutp+voutn | TOOLING |
  | 3 | XC0/XC1 both extract as `VDD VDD`                        | consequence of #2 | TOOLING |
